       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BATCH-INTEGRATION-TEST.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-STATUS PIC X.
       01 REPORT-STATUS PIC X.
       01 RETURN-CODE-VALUE PIC 99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "INPUT DATASET AVAILABLE? (Y/N):"
           ACCEPT INPUT-STATUS

           DISPLAY "REPORT GENERATED? (Y/N):"
           ACCEPT REPORT-STATUS

           DISPLAY "ENTER JOB RETURN CODE:"
           ACCEPT RETURN-CODE-VALUE

           IF INPUT-STATUS = "Y"
               AND REPORT-STATUS = "Y"
               AND RETURN-CODE-VALUE = 0

               DISPLAY "INTEGRATION TEST: PASS"
               DISPLAY "JOB COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "INTEGRATION TEST: FAIL"
               DISPLAY "JOB EXECUTION ERROR"
           END-IF

           STOP RUN.